# Theme Architecture

## 1. CSS Variables (globals.css)

- **:root** = default theme
- **[data-theme="nama"]** = override (sultan, forest, default)
- Format: HSL **tanpa** wrapper: `--primary: 45 93% 47%;`
- @theme inline map ke Tailwind: `--color-background: hsl(var(--background) / <alpha-value>);`

## 2. Tailwind v4

- Warna semantic **tidak** didefinisikan di tailwind.config.ts
- Semua di **globals.css** via @theme inline
- Utilitas: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`, `text-primary`

## 3. ThemeProvider (next-themes)

- `attribute="data-theme"` (bukan `class`)
- `themes=["default","sultan","forest"]`, `enableSystem={false}`
- Atribut diset ke **html** (document.documentElement)

## 4. Layout

- Script beforeInteractive baca localStorage & set `data-theme` sebelum paint
- Body: `bg-background text-foreground`

## 5. Komponen Baru

Gunakan token tema, jangan hardcode:
- `text-foreground` (bukan `text-white`)
- `bg-card` (bukan `bg-[#...]`)
- `text-muted-foreground` untuk teks sekunder
